Package: com.dream.towxreverse.goldenadapter
Name: TOWX WeChat 30 Recent Adapter
Version: 0.11.0-thirty
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Low-intrusion WeChat adapter for up to 30 recent conversations. Uses idle incremental one-cell prefetch, pauses completely during scrolling, keeps global UIView hooks disabled, exports PNG off the main thread, and preserves masked direct chat-to-chat switching.
Maintainer: Dream-zhc
Author: Dream-zhc
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate
